175
00:11:55,480 --> 00:11:56,880
But in our 200 years of Dual Cultivation,

176
00:11:57,720 --> 00:11:59,840
I've always taken care of you, with all my love.

177
00:12:00,200 --> 00:12:00,760
Father,

178
00:12:01,800 --> 00:12:02,280
