204
00:13:35,920 --> 00:13:36,720
My…

205
00:13:37,910 --> 00:13:39,280
My father he…

206
00:13:39,320 --> 00:13:41,120
He shouldn't have been named Teng.

207
00:13:45,560 --> 00:13:46,240
You...

208
00:13:51,640 --> 00:13:52,160
Fine,

209
00:13:52,740 --> 00:13:53,480
both of you

210
00:13:54,700 --> 00:13:55,720
