211
00:14:04,640 --> 00:14:06,200
He killed my father...

212
00:14:09,800 --> 00:14:11,240
Of course she wants revenge.

213
00:14:12,280 --> 00:14:13,520
It looks like

214
00:14:13,880 --> 00:14:15,440
