225
00:14:58,150 --> 00:14:59,280
Forgive me Xiuxiu.

226
00:15:00,720 --> 00:15:02,440
I won’t betray the Wang Family.

227
00:15:20,670 --> 00:15:22,200
Xiuxiu, don’t be scared,

228
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:24,600
I will accompany you.

229
00:15:46,160 --> 00:15:48,640
Between your family and your loved one,

230
00:15:48,640 --> 00:15:51,440
