231
00:15:51,440 --> 00:15:53,640
to atone for your guilt towards your family.

232
00:16:00,460 --> 00:16:01,720
Milady,

233
00:16:01,720 --> 00:16:02,840
hold on a little longer.

234
00:16:04,640 --> 00:16:05,360
Wang Zhuo,

235
00:16:07,070 --> 00:16:08,480
in this next life,

236
00:16:08,520 --> 00:16:10,680
you must step into the cultivation world again.

237
00:16:10,950 --> 00:16:12,120
You have talent.

238
00:16:13,100 --> 00:16:14,680
Maybe we will have another chance

239
00:16:14,680 --> 00:16:16,730
to meet in the future.

240
00:16:16,230 --> 00:16:17,880
It's born !

241
00:16:23,160 --> 00:16:27,160
That year, your soul was sucked away in the Foreign Battlefield.

242
00:16:27,800 --> 00:16:30,470
It turns out you found a great fortune there,

243
00:16:31,520 --> 00:16:33,160
Wang Lin...

244
00:16:33,440 --> 00:16:34,840
Ancestor !

245
00:16:35,130 --> 00:16:36,680
Teng Family City is sealed.

246
00:16:36,680 --> 00:16:37,720
What ?

247
00:16:37,760 --> 00:16:39,360
Someone put a restriction over the city,

248
00:16:39,360 --> 00:16:41,520
