249
00:16:46,080 --> 00:16:46,880
I order you

250
00:16:47,400 --> 00:16:49,000
to wake up Teng One !

251
00:17:00,440 --> 00:17:03,760
Not only did they take the spiritual energy from the mortal's Spirit Roots,

252
00:17:05,160 --> 00:17:06,920
but the Spirit Roots themselves are missing...

253
00:17:08,200 --> 00:17:10,400
The millions of Spirit Roots...

254
00:17:11,600 --> 00:17:12,640
Where are they ?

255
00:17:38,590 --> 00:19:54,090
Here is Teng Three's backstory. It's not important to the plot so read it if you want.
Teng Three’s eyes seemed to be able to see through one’s heart as he looked at Wang Zhuo. His expression didn’t change, so no one knew if he was happy or angry. Waves of emotions surged in his heart as he rubbed Teng Xiuxiu’s hair.
He knew that ever since he was forced by the Ancestor to separate from his wife all those years ago, he will forever live under the shadow of the Ancestor. All of this was because his wife was a mortal and because he was the great great grandson of the Ancestor. An important Teng Family member couldn’t take a mortal as his wife because his descendants must have the qualifications to cultivate.
[...] To a certain extent, Teng Xiuxiu, who looked the most like Teng Three’s wife, received all of the love he had for her. That was why he wouldn’t let Teng Xiuxiu receive any kind of harm or let anyone cause her any grievance.
[...] This flying sword was built by himself. It was named Dao Yun, because his wife’s name contained the word Yun.
Every day, he cleansed the sword with his own spiritual energy. He didn’t let anyone touch this sword, not even Teng Huayuan. He also never used this sword when he fought with others. The degree of adoration he had for this sword wasn’t any lower than what he had for Teng Xiuxiu, because when this sword was made, his wife left a drop of her blood in it.
It was because of this drop of mortal blood that this sword’s power weakened drastically. But Teng Three didn’t care, because as long as this sword was here, his wife was present. If the sword was broken, his wife was dead.
[...] Teng Three quickly jumped up and followed behind the flying sword. He used all of the spiritual energy in his body and moved like a shooting star with the flying sword toward the black cloud.
In the midst of his shooting star-like movement, he could see his wife smiling at him and calling him.
[...] Wang Lin pondered for a long time, but he didn’t take out his soul even though this person would have made an excellent devil. He didn’t think that there would be someone who cared about his loved one so much in the Teng Family. However, he still had to die.
He shouldn’t have been named Teng.

256
00:17:46,800 --> 00:17:50,680
I've had my share of wounds,

257
00:17:48,840 --> 00:17:50,680
now I want to fight back.

258
00:17:50,760 --> 00:17:54,240
Is my destiny a wall of restrictions

259
00:17:54,320 --> 00:18:00,160
that's blocking all my hopes

260
00:17:57,200 --> 00:18:00,160
for life ?

261
00:18:01,960 --> 00:18:05,920
My flesh and blood witnessed the past,

262
00:18:03,680 --> 00:18:05,920
my adversity pushed me to brave the waves.

263
00:18:06,240 --> 00:18:09,320
How do you navigate through the years passing by ?

264
00:18:09,680 --> 00:18:15,320
Nirvana and rebirth are no longer

265
00:18:12,400 --> 00:18:15,320
out of reach.

266
00:18:16,680 --> 00:18:20,800
Immortals

267
00:18:17,720 --> 00:18:20,800
are obsessed with delusions of grandeur.

268
00:18:21,080 --> 00:18:24,840
Renegades

269
00:18:21,840 --> 00:18:24,840
seek to crush the impermanence of the heavens.

270
00:18:24,840 --> 00:18:28,680
Don't tell me that I overestimate myself

271
00:18:26,790 --> 00:18:28,680
and that the path to revenge leads to hell

272
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:32,800
because I don't see the harm in that.

273
00:18:34,800 --> 00:18:40,600
My new body opens its eyes

274
00:18:37,320 --> 00:18:40,600
and awakens from its dream.

275
00:18:40,720 --> 00:18:48,160
I have overcome many trials

276
00:18:42,840 --> 00:18:48,160
to get this body back.

277
00:18:48,360 --> 00:18:55,800
No matter how many endless dark nights go by,

278
00:18:52,400 --> 00:18:55,800
I can still see.

279
00:18:56,200 --> 00:19:05,160
By sticking to this thought, I will get it done

280
00:19:00,160 --> 00:19:05,160
by my own hands.

281
00:19:20,600 --> 00:19:26,560
Returning to my body opened my eyes,

282
00:19:23,320 --> 00:19:26,560
I need to continue my Immortal journey.

283
00:19:26,560 --> 00:19:34,120
With a flick of a finger,

284
00:19:28,000 --> 00:19:34,120
only my indomitable heart remains.

285
00:19:34,160 --> 00:19:43,520
Life and death trials temper me, I am not afraid of losing my soul.

286
00:19:40,120 --> 00:19:43,520
Even if there are countless tribulations and hardships.

287
00:19:43,760 --> 00:19:51,360
Overcome this fate, smash through the obstacles,

288
00:19:46,280 --> 00:19:51,360
like the descent of a god.
